Split these keywords into 2 groups: good English keywords and malformed keywords.

KEEP as good (important for scoring):
- multi-word proper names and places (bill cosby, los angeles county, seattle city council)
- short aliases and abbreviations that are meaningful (la, nyc, ufc, mma, inf 2934)
- topical phrases (cosby estate, mixed martial arts, property records, comprehensive plan)
- publication/domain-like tags (hardwire news, hardwire.news)

ONLY mark malformed if truly broken:
- random character soup, empty tokens, pure numbers, emoji, or unreadable compounds
- generic filler: talk, conversation, discussion, thing, stuff, information

Return exactly this format:
good English keywords: tag1, tag2, tag3
malformed keywords: bad1, bad2

<keywords>
{{tags_string}}
</keywords>
